0..74 Comment "// What divergence as a row entry refuses (#1481): a loop at a row without"
75..160 Comment "// `Partial`, a call of a diverging function from one, a handler of `Partial`, and an"
161..237 Comment "// unread call of a diverging function dropped. Each would let a computation"
238..316 Comment "// that never returns stand where one that returns is expected. What checks is"
317..362 Comment "// in `../../model/control/divergence.gandr`."
